			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Correct VS Code extension dependency path and add remote capability\n\nTwo changes to Mountain configuration:\n\n1. Fix the relative path for locating VS Code extensions in ScanPathConfigure. The path was incorrect (../../../Dependency) and has been corrected to (../../../../Dependency) to properly resolve the VS Code source checkout location.\n\n2. Add remote URL permissions to the default Tauri capability, allowing the editor to make HTTP requests to localhost development servers. This enables development workflows where the editor communicates with local development servers.\n\nThe gen/schemas/capabilities.json is updated to reflect the capability changes.",
			"SHA": "80e7dcf19941ebadcf252012dd4ba10050e6184e"
		}
